Z||000001||PJ||03-31-2001||12:08 AM||||Cheaper & safer to let the machine shop do it while they're honing the bores or whatever. The tools are expensive - around $100 and nobody rents them. You can use the wider small-block bearings but placement of these is more critical than the stock V6 ones. You gotta make sure they're centered between the cam lobes.<P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<BR> ||||reg||1
